Author ruling, 2026-10-27: `/verify-gate` does not run the full suite before the merge.

## Exit criteria

- [x] `.merge-gate.json` declares the before-merge and after-merge check sets; the before set holds no test-suite run.
- [x] A merge records the before set on its candidate and lands; measured end to end with the 1224 duration line, against today's record (88 to 95 s).
- [x] After a merge, the runner runs the full set on the main tip in the background and writes its record as a note on that tip.
- [x] One runner at a time: a merge during a run starts no second runner; the running one tests the newest tip when it ends. A test with three quick merges shows at most two runs, the last on the newest tip.
- [x] A red after-merge record opens a ticket naming the tip, the failing checks and the merges since the last green tip; a test shows it on a planted failure.
- [x] The daily audit reports main tips with no after-merge record and runs the set on the latest one; a test shows it.
- [x] The guard hook and the audit accept a main whose merges carry a before-merge record; `skills/merge/SKILL.md` states the two moments in one place.
- [x] The harness gate passes.
